  "text": "Hare Krishna Prabhu 🙏\nDandwat Pranam\n\n📚 *As It Is*: read the original, unedited books of Vishwaguru His Divine Grace A. C. Bhaktivedanta Swami Prabhupāda, exactly as they were first printed.\n\n✅ Every text checked against the original scanned first-edition prints\n🎧 4,000+ lectures, conversations and morning walks, nearly all with Śrīla Prabhupāda's original audio\n✉️ 6,898 letters, over 5,000 with their original typed pages\n🌅 *A Day with Śrīla Prabhupāda*: what he said, wrote and did on today's date\n🖍️ Highlights, notes and bookmarks; built-in dictionary; English → Hindi translation\n🔎 One search across books, letters and talks\n📴 Works without internet after one download · Free\n\n📥 *Download the As It Is app:*\nhttps://app.asitis.cc/apk/AsItIs-v1.0.apk\n(or: https://github.com/rushhour8/AsItIs-Releases/releases/latest)\n\nPlease share it with other devotees 🙏\nYs"
